Output tapes/out/wrap.mp4
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1600
Set Height 1000
Set Padding 0
Set TypingSpeed 0
Hide
Type 'export COLORTERM=truecolor; H="$PWD"; cd $TMPDIR/cc && clear && "$H/target/release/halftone" wrap claude'
Enter
Sleep 9s
Show
Sleep 1s
Screenshot tapes/out/wrap-claude.png
Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 0.5s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 0.5s
Ctrl+C
